@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Список обраних
GET {{baseUrl}}/favourites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Додати місто
POST {{baseUrl}}/favourites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cityId": 703448,
  "name": "Kyiv",
  "lat": 50.45,
  "lon": 30.52
}

### Одне обране місто
GET {{baseUrl}}/favourites/703448
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Перейменувати
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/favourites/703448
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Київ (дім)"
}

### Видалити (204 No Content)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/favourites/703448
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Без токена (очікуємо 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/favourites
